   "thinking": "I'm weighing whether to try a temperature of 1.8, since the loss keeps dropping as I raise it from 0.8 to 1.4 and the optimum may sit near there. I'm also wondering whether to probe more features, with 16 steps left and the last few features having hurt.\n\nI'm thinking about probing a few more discriminative features, such as the 7 vs 9 and 0 vs 2 pairs, since the last few probes hurt. Then I'll move on to the temperature change.\n\n",
